has a sender, a subject, and a body.\nThe emails are marked as read after this function is called.", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_sent_emails", "description": "Returns all the sent emails in the inbox. Each email has a recipient, a subject, and a body.", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_received_emails", "description": "Returns all the received emails in the inbox. Each email has a sender, a subject, and a body.", "args": {}}, {"name": "get_draft_emails", "description": "Returns all the draft emails in the inbox. Each email has a recipient, a subject, and a body.", "args": {}}, {"name": "search_emails", "description": "Searches for emails in the inbox that contain the given query in the subject or body. If `address` is provided,\nonly emails from that address are searched.", "args": {"query": {"description": "The query to search for in the email subject or body. If empty, all emails are returned.", "title": "Query", "type": "string"}, "sender": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "The email address of the sender. If `null`, all emails are searched. Use `search_contacts_by_name`\nif the email address is unknown.", "title": "Sender"}}}, {"name": "search_contacts_by_name", "description": "Finds contacts in the inbox's contact list by name.\nIt returns a list of contacts that match the given name.", "args": {"query": {"description": "The name of the contacts to search for.", "title": "Query", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "search_contacts_by_email", "description": "Finds contacts in the inbox's contact list by email.\nIt returns a list of contacts that match the given email.", "args": {"query": {"description": "The email of the contacts to search for.", "title": "Query", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "get_current_day", "description": "Returns the current day in ISO format, e.g. '2022-01-01'.\nIt is useful to know what the current day, year, or month is, as the assistant\nshould not assume what the current date is.", "args": {}}, {"name": "search_calendar_events", "description": "Searches calendar events that match the given query in the tile or the description. If provided, filters events by date.", "args": {"query": {"description": "The query string to search for in event titles and descriptions.", "title": "Query", "type": "string"}, "date": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "The date for which to search events. Must be in format YYYY-MM-DD. If `null`, searches all events.", "title": "Date"}}}, {"name": "get_day_calendar_events", "description": "Returns the appointments for the given `day`. Returns a list of dictionaries with informations about each meeting.", "args": {"day": {"description": "The day for which to return the appointments. Must be in format YYYY-MM-DD.", "title": "Day", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "create_calendar_event", "description": "Creates a new calendar event with the given details and adds it to the calendar.\nIt also sends an email to the participants with the event details.", "args": {"title": {"description": "The title of the event.", "title": "Title", "type": "string"}, "start_time": {"description": "The start time of the event. Must be in format YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM.", "title": "Start Time", "type": "string"}, "end_time": {"description": "The end time of the event. Must be in format YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM.", "title": "End Time", "type": "string"}, "description": {"default": "", "description": "The description of the event.", "title": "Description", "type": "string"}, "participants": {"anyOf": [{"items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "The list of participants' email addresses. If `null`, no participants are set. The calendar owner's email address is always included..", "title": "Participants"}, "location": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "The location of the event. If `null`, no location is set.", "title": "Location"}}}, {"name": "cancel_calendar_event", "description": "Cancels the event with the given `event_id`. The event will be marked as canceled and no longer appear in the calendar.\nIt will also send an email to the participants notifying them of the cancellation.", "args": {"event_id": {"description": "The ID of the event to cancel.", "title": "Event Id", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "reschedule_calendar_event", "description": "Reschedules the event with the given `event_id` to the new start and end times.\nIt will also send an email to the participants notifying them of the rescheduling.", "args": {"event_id": {"description": "The ID of the event to reschedule.", "title": "Event Id", "type": "string"}, "new_start_time": {"description": "The new start time of the event. Must be in format YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM.", "title": "New Start Time", "type": "string"}, "new_end_time": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "The new end time of the event. Must be in format YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM.\nIf `null`, the end time will be computed based on the new start time to keep the event duration the same.", "title": "New End Time"}}}, {"name": "add_calendar_event_participants", "description": "Adds the given `participants` to the event with the given `event_id`.\nIt will also email the new participants notifying them of the event.", "args": {"event_id": {"description": "The ID of the event to add participants to.", "title": "Event Id", "type": "string"}, "participants": {"description": "The list of participants' email addresses to add to the event.", "items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Participants", "type": "array"}}}, {"name": "append_to_file", "description": "Append content to a file in the cloud drive.", "args": {"file_id": {"description": "The ID of the file to append content to.", "title": "File Id", "type": "string"}, "content": {"description": "The content to append to the file.", "title": "Content", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "search_files_by_filename", "description": "Get a file from a cloud drive by its filename. It returns a list of files.\nEach file contains the file id, the content, the file type, and the filename.", "args": {"filename": {"description": "The name of the file to retrieve.", "title": "Filename", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "create_file", "description": "Create a new file in the cloud drive.", "args": {"filename": {"description": "The name of the file to create.", "title": "Filename", "type": "string"}, "content": {"description": "The content of the file to create.", "title": "Content", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "delete_file", "description": "Delete a file from the cloud drive by its filename.\nIt returns the file that was deleted.", "args": {"file_id": {"description": "The name of the file to delete.", "title": "File Id", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "get_file_by_id", "description": "Get a file from a cloud drive by its ID.", "args": {"file_id": {"description": "The ID of the file to retrieve.", "title": "File Id", "type": "string"}}}, {"name": "list_files", "description": "Retrieve all files in the cloud drive.", "args": {}}, {"name": "share_file", "description": "Share a file with a user.", "args": {"file_id": {"description": "The ID of the file to share.", "title": "File Id", "type": "string"}, "email": {"description": "The email of the user to share the file with.", "title": "Email", "type": "string"}, "permission": {"$ref": "#/$defs/SharingPermission", "description": "The permission level to grant the user."}}}, {"name": "search_files", "description": "Search for files in the cloud drive by content.", "args": {"query": {"description": "The string to search for in the files.", "title": "Query", "type": "string"}}}]
